For models that support [tool calling](/oss/javascript/langchain/models#tool-calling), AI messages can contain tool calls. Tool messages are used to pass the results of a single tool execution back to the model.

[Tools](/oss/javascript/langchain/tools) can generate [`ToolMessage`](https://reference.langchain.com/javascript/langchain-core/messages/ToolMessage) objects directly. Below, we show a simple example. Read more in the [tools guide](/oss/javascript/langchain/tools).

